      "parameters": {
        "content": "# AI MEMORY ASSISTANT\n\nA Telegram-based AI assistant designed with **two layers of memory**: short-term conversation history stored in PostgreSQL and persistent long-term memories stored in Pinecone.\n\nThe AI Agent uses recent conversations first and intelligently retrieves relevant historical memories only when needed. **Tavily** is available as a web-search tool for current information and recent events.\n\nWhen the short-term conversation reaches its limit, the workflow automatically **summarizes the important context and stores it as long-term memory**, then removes the older messages to keep the active context lightweight.\n\nUsers can also send **`/reset`** to completely clear both short-term and long-term memory and start a fresh conversation.\n",
        "height": 416,
        "width": 640
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
